 - 2026-06-14: Operational retrospective .386 — on the retro's own authoritative timing data, the milestone-scoped detector reported 0 experiment commits since activation (the recurring false-zero gap documented across ~.363-.385; .386 actually ran exp4167-exp4173 per the on-disk changelog window). Both RTX 3090s idle = correct (0 compute-bound tasks present; gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null), so no GPU bottleneck flagged. The .385 observability fallback (exp4161) did not reach this retro's conductor-injected timing feed. Highest-leverage fix: wire the changelog-window fallback into the conductor retro timing path / add commit-to-milestone attribution. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: operational_retro_v386_false_zero_detector_gap_gpu_idle_correct; results/operational_retro_2026_06_386.json
 - 2026-06-14: Archive .386 -> activate .387; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the .386 close-state (outer-loop TRM converged to val 0.8227; decisive graft FIRED but returned a HEADROOM-LIMITED null, verifier_value_added=false, oracle@k 0.8125 ≈ baseline; DiffusionGemma gate STILL-PENDING; ARC total_games_solved=13). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v386_v387_active_outerloop_done_val_0.8227_graft_fired_headroom_limited_null_diffusiongemma_STILL_PENDING; results/experiment_4174_archive_v386_activate_v387.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A1 — Headroom gate + executable-oracle corpus census. Build reusable scripts/headroom_gate.py: for each cached candidate pool compute oracle@k vs baseline pass@1 vs SC-vote with an OBJECTIVE/EXECUTABLE oracle (run code/tests, parse math — NO LLM judge, per arXiv:2605.07395), and flag artifact inflation (truncation/format mismatch). Census {{code HumanEval/MBPP (exp1999/2090/1607), math GSM8K, Sudoku held-out}}. Emit max_selectable_headroom (BARE) + headroom_present_domain. This is the POSITIVE CONTROL the moat test requires. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: headroom_present_domain_code_max_selectable_headroom_0.1800; results/experiment_4175_headroom_gate_executable_census.json
+- 2026-06-14: PHASE A2 — V-STaR learned selector (arXiv:2402.06457). Train an oracle-free selector on ACCEPTED + REJECTED candidate traces (so it learns a correctness boundary, not just imitates winners), out-of-fold. The missing learned-selector verifier class. Deployable ranker consumed by A3. Prefer cached traces; if fresh traces needed, generate from a SOTA GGUF behind a PRECONDITIONS cache check. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: vstar_selector_trained_delta_0.1800_auroc_0.9792; results/experiment_4176_vstar_learned_selector.json
